    "title": "Bible Verse Search-Word Search",
    "description": "If you love to memorize bible verses, try this bible verse search game designed to relieve stress, and bring fun to your day! \r\n\r\nThese incredibly addicting bible verse search puzzle games are brain-blasting fun! Every bible verse puzzle you complete will help you study bible verses and relax!\r\n\r\nFind words on board & connect letters to solve tons of bible verse puzzle levels. Memorizing bible verses has never been easier or more relaxing. \r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n-Easy Game Play! Just swipe letters to complete the bible verse puzzle.\r\n-CHALLENGE your vocabulary.\r\n-Lots of bible verse levels. Play 1000\u2019s puzzle board levels.\r\n-These bible verse search puzzles are easy at the start, but get challenging fast!\r\n\r\nWHY PLAY?\r\n\r\nIf you like to relax and unwind by reading  \u2014you\u2019ll love the bible verse search game! It\u2019s easy at first but gets challenging fast. Can you beat the bible verse search game? Start playing and find out!\r\n\r\nThe Bible verse search game is a modern twist on classic bible verse search puzzles. This brand new bible verse search game is waiting for you to join.",
